{"id":"00027","root":"uni00027_1","name":{"ja":"井河　さくら","en":"Igawa Sakura"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"井河　さくら","en":"Igawa Sakura"},"element":"Natural","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":27,"profile":{"ja":"アサギの妹。いつも明るく陽気で人懐っこい印象を受ける美女。当初、アサギには対魔忍となる事を反対されていたが、姉のように正義のために戦いたいとアサギの反対を押し切って対魔忍となる。その後、カオス・アリーナ、東京キングダムでの死闘ではよく姉を助け、目立たないが優秀な対魔忍として、その名を連ねるまでに。姉同様、カオス・アリーナで改造を受けたが桐生の手によって治癒している。五車学園で教師を務めている。得物は忍者小太刀の二刀流。","en":"Igawa Sakura is Asagi's younger sister, a bright, cheerful beauty who instantly makes a friendly impression. Although Asagi initially opposed her becoming a Taimanin, Sakura pushed past that resistance, determined to fight for justice like her sister, and joined the ranks. Since then, she has repeatedly rescued Asagi in the brutal battles of Chaos Arena and Tokyo Kingdom, earning a reputation as a quietly outstanding Taimanin. Like her sister, she underwent modifications in Chaos Arena but was healed by Kiryu's hands. She now serves as a teacher at Gosha Academy and wields a pair of ninja short swords in a dual-wield style."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"黒岩心々","forms":[{"id":"uni00027_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[946,1892],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[137,275],"def":[120,241],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","73"]},{"id":"uni00027_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1392,2784],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[209,419],"def":[175,351],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","73","74"]},{"id":"uni00027_3","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1838,3676],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[286,572],"def":[235,471],"spd":[78,78],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["4","73","74"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0